# Used by `npm run dev` only (not by `npm run build`). No secrets here.
#
# "/" = call the API on the same address as the page (https://<host>:5173/api/...).
# Vite forwards /api to FastAPI (vite.config.ts), so phones and tunnels only
# need port 5173 and at most one certificate warning.
# Remove this line to call https://<host>:8000 directly instead.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/
